    "closure": "center-adjusted heavy-row exceptions sharpen factor degrees and exclude two d_A=1 profiles",
    "statement": "For each split-biform factor, its classified grid uses Rm_j supported-fiber points and the heavy row can use only the remaining slack sigma_j=3en_j-Rm_j. The off-line factor g_off=g_*/gcd(Lambda,g_*) supplies e-6-d_A supported roots, so the total factorwise root deficit is at most 4+d_A. Hence large odd factors satisfy (q-2)m_j>=3e-8-2d_A and huge even factors satisfy (q-2)m_j>=6e-8-2d_A. At d_A=1 profiles II and III remain impossible.",
